{
 "id": 1286696,
 "titulo": "v450 Update Details",
 "fecha": 1540269974430,
 "modificada": 1733083601717,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1286696",
 "html": "<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Greetings Agents!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">This is <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">CM_Friday</span> of MARVEL Future Fight. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">The Mutant-hunting Sentinel is preparing to invade MARVEL Future Fight!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">This update will reveal a perfect stage for mutants to fully unleash their powers and fight against these machines!<br /> <br /> Welcome to MARVEL Future Fight&rsquo;s <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">X-Men </strong>Update! </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">With <strong>Sentinel</strong> active again, we have requested help from <strong>Gambit</strong> and <strong>Nightcrawler</strong> to fight off the threat!<br /> <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">3 New Characters have been added.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Equipment upgrades for <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Angel, Emma Frost, X-23, </strong>and <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Magneto</strong> have been added to help repel the Sentinel invasion!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">4 New Uniforms have been added this update.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">7 more Characters can achieve their <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Potential</strong>! And on that note, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Magneto</strong> has received his Tier-3 Advancement on this update!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">A new mode, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Giant Boss Raid</strong>, has been added. Cooperate with other agents to defeat the boss!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">And finally, a new <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Type Enhancement</strong> feature where you can maximize the relationship of your characters and more in-game content improvements to add more strategic elements to MARVEL Future Fight have been added! </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">For more information, check out the update details below!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong> <strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Added 3 New Characters!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Sentinel is invading MARVEL Future Fight! However, two more mutants will join in the fight to help repel the invasion!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">Gambit, Nightcrawler, and Sentinel </span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 'MS Mincho'; color: #333333; mso-fareast-language: JA;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">are now in the game.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/1.png\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/1223n.png\" /></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/3.png\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* You can obtain Nightcrawler by purchasing the Premium Hero Chest, Processor: X-Gene and via X-Gene &#83;electors.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">* You can obtain Sentinel by purchasing &ldquo;Get 20 Biometrics Daily&rdquo; from the Mission Shop.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">*</span> <span style=\"color: red;\">You can obtain Gambit by purchasing &ldquo;Get 20 X-Genes Daily&rdquo; from the Mission Shop.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Added 4 New Uniforms!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"color: black; font-size: 12pt;\">Our mutants have received upgrades to help repel Sentinel&rsquo;s invasion!</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Uniforms for <strong>Magneto, Emma Frost, X-23, and Angel&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">have been added to the game.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/4.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/5.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/6.png\" /></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/7.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">* The Skill de&#115;criptions shown above are at Skill Level 1.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: #ff0000;\">* 4 new Uniforms will be on sale during the event sale period. You can check them out on the Marvel Universe menu and by going to the Uniform Room.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Potential for 7 more characters has been added!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Once our October update lands, <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Gambit, Nightcrawler, Sentinel, Angel, Emma Frost, X-23 and Magneto</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #666666;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"> will be able to have their Potential unlocked! </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #666666;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">You can raise them up to level 70.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/8.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Magneto receives his Tier-3 Advancement!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Magneto receives his Tier-3 Upgrade!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Unlock the skill and witness the full power of one of the most powerful mutants!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"https://i.giphy.com/media/Cjt8fS179TSLEHes4R/giphy.webp\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231224/9.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">New Mode: Giant Boss Raid!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">This is one boss you cannot face alone. Cooperate with fellow agents to clear the challenge!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/r1223.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">You must have 3 or more Tier-2 Level 60 or higher, 6★ Rank and 6★ Mastery Characters to participate in the Giant Boss Raid mode.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Agents who meet the conditions above can challenge the boss by creating or joining a Lobby.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Three agents can participate in the Giant Boss Raid mode at the same time.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Malgun Gothic','sans-serif'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #333333;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/r1224.png\" /><br /><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt; color: #0000ff;\">- If the Lobby is made as private, only Agents from the same Alliance can be invited by the Lobby creator.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt; color: #0000ff;\">- Agents that are not part of a Lobby can enter a Lobby using &ldquo;Quick Start&rdquo;.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt; color: #0000ff;\">- If there is no Lobby available after pressing &ldquo;Quick Start&rdquo;, a new Public Lobby will be automatically created.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt; color: #0000ff;\">- You can invite Alliance Members who are online into your lobby.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">- Once you receive an invitation, a pop-up window will appear and you'll be able to join the lobby immediately!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/r1225.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">You can use your Boost Points and meet the Recommended Character requirement to increase your rewards.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: black; mso-themecolor: text1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Using Boost Points can increase the reward count, and if you meet the Recommended Character requirement, the Reward Acquisition Chance will also be higher.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/r1226.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0000ff;\">- Each time you clear Giant Boss Raid, the Recommended Character bonus will reset.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Only one of your chosen Characters can participate in this game mode at any given time.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">Auto Play is not supported in this mode. If all of the Characters participating in the mode are defeated or if you do not defeat the boss before the time limit, your team will lose.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 나눔고딕;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">When you clear a Giant Boss Raid stage, you can receive an item useful for our new feature, </span><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Type Enhancement.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Added a new feature: Type Enhancement System</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">A new enhancement system has been added to make your characters even stronger!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\"><br /> Start your battles with an advantage as every character has their own unique Type Enhancement buff!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Type Enhancement materials can be obtained by playing the <strong>Giant Boss Raid</strong> mode.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/t1223.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">On the Team menu, you can go to the Type Enhancement screen by &#115;electing Type on the left side of the screen.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231410/1323123132.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">- You have to meet certain requirements before you can proceed with enhancing a character&rsquo;s Type.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">If Type Enhancement is successful, the values indicated on the enhancement screen will increase.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">If the enhancement fails, the items you used for enhancement will be consumed, and your enhancement rank will stay the same.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/t1225.png\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/t1226.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0000ff;\">- The materials needed for enhancement varies per Character.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0000ff;\">- The effect of each Enhancement Rank is different per Rank.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0000ff;\">- The maximum Rank for Type Enhancements is Rank 6.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">New Gold Package in the shop for dire situations!</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Agents usually lose a lot of Gold after upgrading a lot of their characters. </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">We&rsquo;re now introducing a new product that you can only buy in urgent situations! </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">If you have less than a certain amount of gold, you can purchase this item.</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231248/12333g.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt;\">- You can only purchase this package if you have less than 1,000,000 Gold.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Other Game Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">1. You can now enable or disable the &ldquo;Auto-Repeat&rdquo; function while on a mission.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1221.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">2. Alliance Conquest has been improved to allow reviving of multiple members of your team at once instead of having to revive them one at a time.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1222.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">3. The Alliance Support feature has been improved to show who accepted your support request.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1223.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #0000ff;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\">- We look forward to seeing Agents diligently support their Alliance members!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">4. The Special Mission &ndash; Hidden Ticket prompt has been improved.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1224.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0000ff;\">- The checkbox has been removed and you can now choose whether or not you want to use a Hidden Ticket.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">5. Uniform Sorting in [Uniform Room] has been improved.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1225.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">- You can now check which Uniform is equipped to your character easily; the equipped uniform is on top.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">6. On the [My Team] &ndash; [Character Info] &ndash; [Uniform] screen, you can now replay the Tier-3 Rank-Up Animation for each Uniform that was shown after you reached Tier-3 with your &#115;elected character.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1226.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #0000ff;\">- You can now watch the Tier-3 animation of your owned Uniforms anytime!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">7. In [World Boss] mode, you can now easily check the content of Special World Boss Booty as shown below.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1227.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt; color: #0000ff;\">- You can now see what items you can obtain in this chest!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">8. When using X-Gene, Character and Biometric &#83;electors, you can now view more information regarding character gear, Uniforms the Character has and where to obtain them aside from the &#115;elector.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1228.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">9. The Mission Preparation screen has been improved to show your current leader&rsquo;s skill icon and its current status, regardless of whether it is activated or not.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><img src=\"http://c2.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/10/231302/o1229.png\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 10pt; color: #0000ff;\">- You can now check the Character&rsquo;s Leader Skill in the Mission Preparation screen, even if the current leader does not have any mastery levels yet.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">10. World Boss Invasion Co-Op Mission has been improved.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">- The following Co-op Missions have been changed: </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp; &ldquo;Clear the stage while using Co-op Skills more than 3 times&rdquo; has been changed to 1 time.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">- The following Co-op Mission has been added:</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-indent: 9.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&ldquo;Clear the stage without losing less than one Character.&rdquo;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">11. Limited Event improvement</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: Gulim; color: #333333; mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">-Upon Clearing the Limited Event Mission, a &ldquo;Go To&rdquo; pop-up notification will appear.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">Other Game Fixes</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;Fixed the issue where HP Recovery from a Character's Skill and from CUSTOM GEAR were not working at the same time.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">2. Fixed Arachknight and Agent Venom &rsquo;s Character tips to display the correct information.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">3. Fixed an issue where if you use a Uniform with a debuff effect, the uniform effect of your opponent gets canceled out.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">4. An issue where a high score notification appeared even if you did not reach that score in Alliance Battle mode has been fixed.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\">Thank you for your continued support of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 나눔고딕; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">We hope you enjoy our latest update: X-Men and the Sentinel!</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
}